#. Translators: name of the application, as displayed in the window manager
#. Translators: name of the application, as displayed in the About dialog, some window managers, etc.
#: data/org.gnome.five-or-more.metainfo.xml.in:7
#: data/org.gnome.five-or-more.desktop.in:2 data/ui/five-or-more.ui:123
#: src/main.vala:27
msgid "Five or More"
msgstr "Fem eller meir"

#: data/org.gnome.five-or-more.metainfo.xml.in:8
#: data/org.gnome.five-or-more.desktop.in:3
msgid "Remove colored balls from the board by forming lines"
msgstr "Fjern farga ballar frå brettet ved å laga linjer"

#: data/org.gnome.five-or-more.metainfo.xml.in:10
msgid ""
"Five or More is the GNOME port of a once-popular computer game. Align five "
"or more objects of the same color into a line to cause them to disappear and "
"score points. Earn many more points by lining up as many objects as possible "
"before clearing them."
msgstr ""
"Five or More er GNOME-versjonen av eit tidlegare populært dataspel. Still "
"opp fem eller fleire objekt med same farge på ei linje, så forsvinn dei og "
"du får poeng. Du får mykje meir poeng ved å stille opp så mange objekt som "
"mogleg før du fjernar dei."

#: data/org.gnome.five-or-more.metainfo.xml.in:16
msgid ""
"More objects appear after every turn. Play for as long as possible, until "
"the board is completely full!"
msgstr ""
"Fleire objekt dukkar opp etter kvart trekk. Spel så lenge som mogleg, til "
"brettet er heilt fullt!"

#. Translators: About dialog text, name of one of the artists
#: data/org.gnome.five-or-more.metainfo.xml.in:42 src/main.vala:113
msgid "Robert Roth"
msgstr "Robert Roth"

